:"### Tested versions\n\nError thrown in Godot v4.4.rc1\nNo error in Godot v4.3-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7242) - AMD Ryzen 7 3700X 8-Core Processor (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nA .gdshaderinc with a default case at the top of the scope in a switch statement throws an error in Godot 4.4 RC 1. But not in 4.3. \nError: Cases must be defined before default case.\n\nMaybe this is the intended behavior, but it does make the transition from previous versions more difficult. \n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create an empty project.\n2. Add a file `test.gdshaderinc`\n3. Open the file and paste this code:\n```\nvoid test() {\n\tswitch (0) {\n\t\tdefault:\n\t\t\tbreak;\n\t\tcase 0:\n\t\t\tbreak;\n\t};\n}\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[switch_4_3_stable.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18923269/switch_4_3_stable.zip)\n\n[switch_4_4_rc1.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18923281/switch_4_4_rc1.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User",